# Architect 062606ZA F1: keep scripts/ and out/web_dist; exclude the rest of out/.
# Do not git-add workspace-images/out/. `out/*` (not `out/**`) so `!out/web_dist/`
# can re-include the host-baked dashboard assets.
out/*
!out/web_dist/
!out/web_dist/**
# MTA CLI 8.2 archive (download page, checksum-gated in the Dockerfile)
!out/mta-*-cli-linux-amd64.zip
# Hermes runtime patch series (stages/130-ai-autonomous-migration/hermes-runtime)
!out/hermes-runtime-patches/
!out/hermes-runtime-patches/**
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
# outcome-board authority (local build only)
!out/outcome-authority/
!out/outcome-authority/**
# typed repair executor jar (built and sha-checked by build-130-runtime-image.sh step 2b)
!out/typed-repair/
!out/typed-repair/typed-repair.jar
out/typed-repair/build/
